                        "stem','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:14px;\">This application uses the </span><span style=\" font-family:'Courier New'; font-size:14px;\">Telemetrix4Arduino</span><span style=\" font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:14px;\"> Arduino library to communicate with the test fixture. It can be compilled and uploaded via the Arduino IDE or the </span><span style=\" font-family:'Courier New'; font-size:14px;\">arduino-cli</span><span style=\" font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:14px;\"> tool. The installation of the firmware can be automated using the </span><a href=\"Scripts/Install.ps1\"><span style=\" font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:14px; text-decoration: underline; "
                        "color:#7cfbfc;\">Install.ps1</span></a><span style=\" font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:14px;\"> script. This script will download the </span><span style=\" font-family:'Courier New'; font-size:14px;\">arduino-cli</span><span style=\" font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:14px;\"> tool, install the required libraries, compile the firmware, and upload it to the Arduino. It prompts for the COM port of the Arduino before uploading the firmware. Modify the file </span><a href=\"https://github.com/dhahaj/EAX-Python-Interface/blob/main/sketches/Telemetrix4Arduino/Telemetrix4Arduino.ino\"><span style=\" font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:14px; text-decoration: underline; color:#7cfbfc;\">Telemetrix4Arduino.ino</span></a><span style=\" font"
                        "-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:14px;\"> to make modifications to the firmware, such as changing the </span><span style=\" font-family:'Courier New'; font-size:14px;\">arduino_instance_id</span><span style=\" font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:14px;\">. See </span><a href=\"https://mryslab.github.io/telemetrix/\"><span style=\" font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:14px; text-decoration: underline; color:#7cfbfc;\">The Telemetrix Project</span></a><span style=\" font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:14px;\"> for more information.</span></p>\n"
